        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "IN8fD",
          "name": "Rules",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "$bg-card",
          "cornerRadius": 4,
          "stroke": "$border",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "strokeAlignment": "inner",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 10,
          "padding": [
            24,
            28
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "gkEog",
              "name": "Rules Title",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "content": "規則摘要",
              "fontFamily": "$font-heading",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "yGMZl",
              "name": "Rule",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• 兩岸各一台：左＝過去岸（MT01，深色機身），右＝今天岸（MT02，灰色機身）。平常放出的那岸全尺寸，對岸 0.75 倍、70% 透明度待機。",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "hE8JV",
              "name": "Rule",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• 訊號抵達時對岸恢復全尺寸並亮燈；送出的人只看到「已抵達對岸」，看不到內容。",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "JrgN1",
              "name": "Rule",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• 打開對岸收到的是河裡別人更早放出的一句（放一句、河還一句）；原型先用作者文章的句子。",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "lEN7w",
              "name": "Rule",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• 光點漂流約 3–4 秒，經過的日期節點微亮；reduced motion 時不移動，對岸直接亮燈。",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "EKHgO",
              "name": "Rule",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• 只在 /my-tide 首頁出現；沉浸閱讀時兩台都退場，訊號排隊。",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "P6wtiL",
              "name": "Rule",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• 待機時「寫訊號」以冷白光暈緩慢明滅（1.6 秒一循環），讀者第一次按過後停止；紅色只留給訊號傳送。鍵盤分中文（注音＋選字）、英文（含數字列）、數字與標點三層。",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
