              "fontSize": 22,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "W9JnNB",
              "name": "Item",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• 推薦播放器：極簡內嵌條「送給『今天』的歌」（v5.1）。取代原本的 A / B：只保留一行小標題與一條 22px 銀灰播放條（播放／暫停｜時間｜進度｜總長｜音量刻度），歌名淡淡跟在標題後，上一首／下一首是淡色 ‹ ›。不醒目。",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "NaxRe",
              "name": "Item",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• 放置：放在 JournalMark 意識流波浪線正下方，寬 200px，與波浪同寬，像標誌下的一行註腳。手機上收成同位置的一行小條（▷＋標題），點了才展開。",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "SOJSh",
              "name": "Item",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• 兩個獨立掛件：BB Call 在時間之河上緣兩端（過去岸／今天岸），播放器在 JournalMark 下方；互不重疊、不共用狀態，也不互相觸發。",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "mZKOe",
              "name": "Item",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• JournalMark 意識流動畫（小圓沿波浪線移動）原樣保留；播放器只在它下方，不覆蓋。",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "TbO0O",
              "name": "Item",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• 播放行為：不自動播放；換日期或文章時持續播放；進入〈大爆炸〉等互動作品不切歌、不開始播放。",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "v7G6K",
              "name": "Item",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• 手機輸入：「寫訊號」同一次點擊內顯示並 focus 真正的 <textarea>；原生鍵盤負責中／英／數字／符號與注音組字；手機不顯示裝飾性注音鍵盤；字數上限沿用 40 字。",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "yrYcb",
              "name": "Item",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• 檢查：所有設計板已用 Pencil 版面檢查，無文字、按鍵裁切或元件重疊（少數回報為浮點誤差，已逐一確認）。v2、v3、v4 設計板未修改。",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
