                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "我數學一直都不好。",
                      "lineHeight": 2,
                      "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "ND2yp",
                      "name": "Gap",
                      "width": 1,
                      "height": 29
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "oDeAo",
                      "name": "Paragraph",
                      "opacity": 0.55,
                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "但我的理解是，月亮距離我1.3光秒，所以我現在看到的月亮是1.3秒之前的月亮；而太陽距離我八光分多一點，所以所謂的此刻落在我身上的陽光，其實已經在太空裡先走了八分多鐘。",
                      "lineHeight": 2,
                      "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "ciqlP",
                      "name": "Gap",
                      "width": 1,
                      "height": 29
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "lELAo",
                      "name": "Paragraph",
                      "opacity": 0.2,
                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "如果一個人站在兩光年（距離）之外看地球，他所看見的，也會是兩年前從地球出發的光、兩年前地球的模樣。",
                      "lineHeight": 2,
                      "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "xh9oF",
                      "name": "Gap",
                      "width": 1,
                      "height": 29
                    }
